  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Skill. Charm target animal. Once charmed, your animal companion will travel with you whenever you have Charm Animal equipped. You cannot charm an animal that is more than 4 levels above you.",
      "zhTW": "迷魅目標動物。一旦迷魅成功，只要你裝備此技能時，你的寵物夥伴將會與你一同旅行。你無法迷魅任何比高於你4等級的動物。"
    },
